@startuml
title Class Diagram: Cultivating a Luminous Mind

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor LightBlue
  BorderColor DarkBlue
  ArrowColor DarkGreen
  FontName SansSerif
  FontSize 12
  AttributeFontColor DarkGreen
  StereotypeFontColor DarkRed
}

' Define main entities
class Mind {
  + state: Luminous, Sullied, Freed 
  + malleability: Pliant, Unpliant 
  + development: Developed, Undeveloped 
  + control_state: Tamed, Untamed, Guarded, Unguarded 
  + current_qualities: Impassioned, Averse, Deluded, Intoxicated 
  + concentration_state: Concentrated, Unconcentrated, Unified, Scattered 
  + release_state: Released, Unreleased 
}

class Practitioner {
  + instruction_level: WellInstructed, Uninstructed 
  + disposition: Ardent, Resolute 
  + practice_level: In Training, Arahant 
}

class Mindfulness {
  + is_established: Boolean 
  + proficiency: Excellent 
  + scope: Body, Feelings, Mind, Mental Qualities 
  + type: In-&-Out Breathing, Immersed in Body 
}

class Alertness {
  + awareness_of_phenomena: Boolean (arising, persisting, subsiding) 
  + manifested_in_actions: Boolean (e.g., going, looking, eating) 
}

class Heedfulness {
  + is_bright_quality: Boolean 
  + guards_world: Boolean 
  + prevents_defilements: Boolean 
  + represents_knowledge: Boolean 
}

class Concentration {
  + type: Immeasurable, Right, Themeless, Five-Factored 
  + quality: Peaceful, Exquisite 
}

class Jhāna {
  + stage_number: 1, 2, 3, 4 
  + characteristics: String (e.g., "rapture & pleasure born of seclusion") 
}

class SenseFaculties {
  + types: Eye, Ear, Nose, Tongue, Body, Intellect 
  + state: Guarded, Unguarded 
}

class Dhamma {
  + teaching_quality: Well-Taught, Timeless, Inviting Verification 
  + ultimate_purpose: Purification, Unbinding 
}

class Unbinding {
  + is_cessation_of_stress: Boolean 
  + is_end_of_effluents: Boolean 
  + outcomes: Gnosis, Non-return 
}

class Effluent {
  + types: Sensuality, Becoming, Ignorance 
}

class Knowledge {
  + types: Clear Knowing, Direct Knowledge, Insight Knowledge 
  + scope: Ending Effluents, Awareness of Others 
}

class Virtue {
  + purity_qualities: Untorn, Unbroken, Liberating 
}

class Craving {
  + types: For Sensuality, Becoming, Non-Becoming 
  + role: Seamstress (stitches to becoming), Moisture (for consciousness) 
}

class Ignorance {
  + lacks_knowledge_of: Stress, Origination/Cessation/Path of Stress 
  + causes_defilement: Boolean 
}

class Stress {
  + aspects: Origination, Cessation, Path of Practice 
}


' Define relationships

Practitioner "1" --o "1" Mind : possesses / develops > 
Practitioner "1" --> "*" Mindfulness : cultivates 
Practitioner "1" --> "*" Alertness : cultivates 
Practitioner "1" --> "*" Heedfulness : practices 

Mindfulness "1" --> "1" Alertness : enables 
Mindfulness "1" --|> "0..*" Concentration : leads_to_concentration 
Mindfulness "1" --> "1" SenseFaculties : guards 
Mindfulness "1" --> "1" Dhamma : is_governing_principle_for 

Alertness "1" --> "1" Mind : supports_mind_state 

Heedfulness "1" --|> "0..*" Knowledge : is_a_form_of_knowledge 
Heedfulness "1" --> "1" Defilement : prevents 
Heedfulness "1" --> "1" Effluent : leads_to_ending 
Heedfulness "1" <|-down- "1" Heedlessness : opposite_of 

Concentration "1" *-- "1..4" Jhāna : comprises 
Concentration "1" --> "1" Knowledge : leads_to 
Concentration "1" --> "1" Effluent : ends 

Mind "1" --> "*" Effluent : is_defiled_by 

Effluent "1" --> "1" Ignorance : is_origination_of 

Knowledge "1" --> "1" Unbinding : results_in 
Knowledge "1" --> "1" Effluent : ends 

Virtue "1" --> "1" Concentration : supports 

Craving "1" --> "1" Stress : causes 
Craving "1" --> "1" Ignorance : rooted_in 
Craving "1" --> "1" Karma : fuels 

Ignorance "1" --> "1" Stress : causes 

Stress "1" <--> "1" Unbinding : resolved_by 

Dhamma "1" --> "1" Unbinding : leads_to 

' Note on diagram level: This class diagram is a high-level representation, focusing on the primary entities and their direct relationships as described or strongly implied by the document. A deeper dive into all aspects (e.g., all types of karma, every specific meditation object) would result in a much larger and more complex diagram.
' The document focuses heavily on the interconnectedness of these concepts, often describing processes or causal links that form implicit relationships between entities.

@enduml